  "the_hard_invariant": "A page cannot choose its own hero. The route registry chooses the hero. If agents choose heroes, they will make posters. You want instruments.",

  "agent_mission_statement": "Implement PRIMER-1 without creating parallel canon. HARD RULES: 1. Only author canon: design-primer.md, design-tokens.json, design-rules.json, page-instruments.json. 2. Do NOT create: DESIGN_V2.md, design-final.md, tokens-new.json, theme-v2.css, hero-system.md. 3. Do NOT hand-edit generated CSS. Source: design-tokens.json. Output: public/_shared/design-system/tokens.css. 4. Every route hero must be declared in page-instruments.json. 5. Every page must load shared tokens and declare: territory, channel, state, seal_status. 6. If a needed field is missing, update the canon schema or produce a proposal. Do not invent local fields. 7. Before mutation: output files touched, file authority, generated outputs, verification commands, rollback plan.",

  "build_order": {
    "1_design_primer": "canon/design-primer.md — narrative home (DRAFT pending)",
    "2_design_tokens": "canon/design-tokens.json — JSON machine law (ratified PRIMER-1.0)",
    "3_design_rules": "canon/design-rules.json — lintable invariants (DRAFT pending)",
    "4_page_instruments": "canon/page-instruments.json — route hero registry (DRAFT pending)",
    "5_verify_design_canon": "scripts/verify-design-canon.cjs — CI lint",
    "6_one_reference_page": "/earth — first instrument page to validate the contract"
  },

